@MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5110

### Listar los platos activos
GET {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes
Accept: application/json

### Listar solo los platos disponibles
GET {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes?available=true
Accept: application/json

### Consultar un plato
GET {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes/2
Accept: application/json

### Crear un plato
POST {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Changua",
  "description": "Caldo de leche con huevo, cebolla larga y cilantro, servido con calado.",
  "price": 12000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/changua.jpg",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Reemplazar un plato
PUT {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Changua",
  "description": "Caldo de leche con huevo, cebolla larga y cilantro, servido con calado.",
  "price": 13500,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/changua.jpg",
  "isAvailable": false
}

### Retirar un plato del menú (borrado lógico)
DELETE {{MiRestaurante.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dishes/6
